  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Give it a sec for the pain to start",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "This wreck right here, it ain't for the faint of heart",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "They thought they saw the worst verse",
          "rhyme": "ERs",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "From the team of G men who seem like nerds at first",
          "rhyme": "Est",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Once they get to know us, people dig us",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Leaders in the fight for equal rights for niggas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Inventor of the more demented-er flow, no ’bout a-doubt it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "This go for if you're 'bout it, ’bout it or rowdy, rowdy",
          "rhyme": "i",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Whatever's clever, the master foe",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Who еvery hooker heard of, but nar' a ho know",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "If wе see tomorrow, the next day classes",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "The Villain in the back with the X-ray glasses",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Have no fear, the ninja here",
          "rhyme": "eR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Feel 'em like the tinge in your ear from drinkin' ginger beer",
          "rhyme": "ER",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "When it's on, loco head gon' lay low",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "And heat it like beef patty, coco bread con queso",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "If you say so, lace the whole caseload",
          "rhyme": "ad",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "They say he wear a metal mask in case his face show",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "He told 'em they flows is bitch talk and \"aiyyo\"s",
          "rhyme": "Es",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "His whole crew walk with pitchfork and halos",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Say \"ho\" if you never worked a J-O’",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "And keep more cash in a stash than the pay show",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Okay, yo, y’all know who to follow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Tie 'em up in the crib and leave they place hollow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Oh, shoot, the goose, she’s loose",
          "rhyme": "uz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "So wild you couldn't chase it down with straight fruit juice",
          "rhyme": "is",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Frown, like the first time you taste couscous",
          "rhyme": "us",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Stash the deuce deuce, troops askin' \"truce, truce\"",
          "rhyme": "ys",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Today on intense wreck week",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "We have the Supervillain in his own defense to speak",
          "rhyme": "Ek",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "It's all part of my mental techniques",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Available to freaks and pencil-neck geeks",
          "rhyme": "ik",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Train a sane brain to an insane train of thought",
          "rhyme": "ajt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "On a campaign trail he came to gain your support",
          "rhyme": "OR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Charge cash for a autograph",
          "rhyme": "aS",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Say some shit to make your daughter laugh, then slaughter the ass",
          "rhyme": "as",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "See ’em on the big screen like Steve McQueen",
          "rhyme": "in",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Do somethin' and never be back once he leaves the scene",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Keep more medicated pads than Stridex",
          "rhyme": "Eks",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "For his own side wreck with no known side effects",
          "rhyme": "Ekt",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "40",
          "text": "Before you press charges, use your noodle",
          "rhyme": "odl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "41",
          "text": "So what? When he grab the mic, he crush your cute cuticles",
          "rhyme": "ikl",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "42",
          "text": "Keep your mouth shut, everything will be beautiful",
          "rhyme": "9l",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "43",
          "text": "It would be awfully rude of you, now get back to your hootie-hoo",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "44",
          "text": "Damn it, it ain't worth the drama – can it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "45",
          "text": "From the calm bandit, eat rhymers like pomegranate",
          "rhyme": "at",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "46",
          "text": "Soon as he stepped in, he lit the room",
          "rhyme": "um",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "47",
          "text": "Boom, reschedule my noon with Brit Hume",
          "rhyme": "ym",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "48",
          "text": "(DOOM!) In love with Mary Jane, she's my main thing",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "49",
          "text": "Pulled her right from that web-head, what a lame brain",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "50",
          "text": "Maintain and say it, don't spray it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "51",
          "text": "You wanna see your girl again, you might as well pay it",
          "rhyme": "it",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "52",
          "text": "If I had a dime for every rhymers that bust guns",
          "rhyme": "9n",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "53",
          "text": "I'd have a cool mil' for my sons in trust funds",
          "rhyme": "wndz",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "54",
          "text": "When I was broker than a broke dick dog",
          "rhyme": "Og",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "55",
          "text": "I always kept a L to smoke in thick fog",
          "rhyme": "Og",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "56",
          "text": "When it rain, it sure do thunderstorm",
          "rhyme": "uRm",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "57",
          "text": "I got more rhymes in the summer than musty underarms",
          "rhyme": "Om",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "58",
          "text": "One, two, microphone checker",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "59",
          "text": "First learned to neck off a Home Ec. homewrecker",
          "rhyme": "9R",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "60",
          "text": "This is back when he was like crib age",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "61",
          "text": "When he hit the stage, it's like a gauge to the rib cage",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "62",
          "text": "Break the mic like a rock star break a guitar",
          "rhyme": "aR",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "63",
          "text": "And jump off the stage like, \"Yee haw!\"",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        }
